erage city kid who receives a text message from an unknown source instructing him to \"board a train towards his destiny\". Taking up the Call to Adventure, he finds the train in question and is whisked off to the Digital World, which is currently under threat from the malevolent Cherubimon. Cherubimon and his minions are consuming the very building blocks of the Digital World (its \"Fractal Code\") to increase their own power, and if nothing is done then the entire Digital World will be devoured.\n\nAll is not lost, however. Takuya and the other \"chosen\" children who boarded the train inherit the power of the Ten Legendary Warriors that saved the Digital World in the distant past, allowing them to transform themselves into Digimon. With their new powers, they fight to take back the stolen Fractal Code and restore the fractured Digital World to its former glory.\n\n(Source: TV Tropes)"},"tags":[{"name":"Kids","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Virtual World","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":90,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Trains","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kaiju","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":65,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Angels","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Monster Girl","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fairy","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Nudity","rank":15,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Digimon Frontier","english":null,"native":"デジモンフロンティア","romaji":"Digimon Frontier","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"数码宝贝无限地带"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"数码兽前线地带"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"数码兽边缘地带"},